**Session 2 summary — criteria NOT met yet; substantial convergence.**

**Root causes proven and fixed this session (v0.11.47 → 0.11.53, build CFF7AD86, built but not yet deployed):**

1. **Inobt double-free root (flavor 1) was not buffer divergence** — the P144 cross-node join proved every cold read FRESH and the record braid coherent. The real chain: a clean in-core zombie inode kept at a handoff re-acquire because P116's keep was handoff-blind (peer realloc assigns a *random* generation, defeating the gen+1 arm). Fixed with a handoff-bit-gated adopt — firing and rescuing live.
2. **Truncate-on-flipped-incarnation** (`__xfs_bunmapi` on a dir fork) — added SETSIZE-REVALIDATE (clean -ESTALE after the EX-acquire reload; VFS retries). Firing and rescuing.
3. **Ifree double-free mid-inactivation** — two revalidation arms in `xfs_inactive_ifree` (adopted-free image; coherent-empty AGI bucket = undestaged concurrent peer free).
4. **The 184s cross-node deadlock family** (three stack-captured shapes) — added the `xfs_lock_two_inodes` bounded-second-acquire backoff (P-ABBA-BACKOFF, firing ~48×/round) and, per a GPT design consult, the **dialloc-time child-ino reservation** before the inobt RMW (enforcing "no new blocking DLM acquire after the transaction is dirty") — the both-edges-dirty deadlock shape hasn't recurred since.
5. **Leaked AGI bucket entry** on inode reuse now heals (P-IUNLINK-RECYCLE-HEAL) instead of shutting down the cluster from a dirty droplink.

**Remaining wall:** the dir/AGI lineage family — one round showed dir 131's block0 and its new leaf mapped to the same physical block (a stale-base dir-block free is suspected), another showed durable on-disk dinode garbage. New instrumentation (P145-ALLOC, P148-DIRSHRINK, P34C coherency stamps) is in the build to name the poison step on next firing. Next session: deploy CFF7AD86, run fresh-FS-per-round churn, autopsy with the new probes, then the verification ladder (≥5 clean rounds → deadshell_repro → full suite) and the task-#3 open items. All state is in memory (`ccloop4dd7-sess2-B-final-state-and-next`).

